  "bodyHash": "ecc0a072c70df913",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_196f6f98-864c-4169-9b08-4a2f7f9fa0ba.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">添加了超过 15 道新菜肴，以及一款非常独特的药水。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_e8d34b19-74aa-43fb-aea1-cafebfa71022.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">引入“点石成金”效果！</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_84690c49-3606-4451-b0ca-076ff64aa6ac.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过捕获极其罕见且传说中的迈达斯鱼，你可以使用切菜板将其处理为“迈达斯鱼肉末”。食用后你将获得“点石成金”效果，在 10 秒内把你挖掘的所有方块变成黄金。为了充分利用此效果，可以将其制成“点石成金药水”。若想进一步延长持续时间，只需在药水中加入红石即可。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br>需要 Farmer's Delight、Tide 和 Cultural Delights</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><em>喜欢 Tide's Delight？欢迎查看我的其他模组：</em><em style=\"font-size:16px\"><br><br></em></h3>\n<h3><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1197295/description_28656b03-9b0f-4204-b92a-6a2184075651.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"249\"></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">C</a></strong></span><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ri</a></strong><strong style=\"color:#fff;font-size:16px\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">tter Colonies（适用于 Minecolonies）</a></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1084244/description_206db7ed-db55-4a24-886d-a5e549771d86.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"58\"><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beginnings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">Better Beginnings</span></a></strong></em></p>\n<p><br><em><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_61d5e43e-8b6b-4505-b1c9-4553625ece93.png\" width=\"222\" height=\"222\"><br><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts-continued\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Creatures and Beasts: Continued</span></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
